{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "C17 图标包（manifest v3，规范 3.1）",
  "description": "图标包规范 3.1（docs/ICON-PACK-SPEC.zh-CN.md）：每个图标画在所替换系统图标的参考画布上并写 \"fit\": \"canvas\"（App302 起识别）；不写 fit 的图标按 3.0 旧规则裁边撑满。蜂窝双排角色要求 beta96/code189 及以上。schema 只做字段提示，不能替代 tools/validate_pack.py、tools/check_spec.py 与模块的实际导入。",
  "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["format", "version", "fallback", "id", "name", "license", "icons"],
  "properties": {
    "format": {"const": "c17-statusbar-icons"}, "version": {"const": 3}, "fallback": {"const": "native"},
    "id": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$"},
    "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64},
    "author": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 128},
    "license": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128},
    "icons": {
      "type": "object", "minProperties": 1, "maxProperties": 512,
      "propertyNames": {
        "type": "string", "maxLength": 128,
        "pattern": "^(hint|wifi|cellular|battery|tile|slider|media|device|footer)(\\.[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_]{0,47}){1,5}$",
        "if": {"pattern": "^cellular(?:\\.|$)"},
        "then": {"enum": [
          "cellular.none", "cellular.0", "cellular.1", "cellular.2", "cellular.3", "cellular.4",
          "cellular.stacked_primary.none", "cellular.stacked_primary.0", "cellular.stacked_primary.1",
          "cellular.stacked_primary.2", "cellular.stacked_primary.3", "cellular.stacked_primary.4",
          "cellular.stacked_secondary.none", "cellular.stacked_secondary.0", "cellular.stacked_secondary.1",
          "cellular.stacked_secondary.2", "cellular.stacked_secondary.3", "cellular.stacked_secondary.4"
        ]}
      },
      "additionalProperties": {"$ref": "#/$defs/staticAsset"}
    },
    "transitions": {
      "type": "object", "maxProperties": 128,
      "propertyNames": {"pattern": "^tile(\\.[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_]{0,47}){1,4}\\.(off_to_on|on_to_off|transient)$"},
      "additionalProperties": {"$ref": "#/$defs/transition"}
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "digest": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^([a-f0-9]{64})?$"},
    "staticAsset": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["source"],
      "properties": {
        "source": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^assets/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,95}\\.(png|xml)$"},
        "render": {"enum": ["mask", "color"], "default": "mask"}, "sha256": {"$ref": "#/$defs/digest"},
        "fit": {"enum": ["canvas", "visible"], "default": "visible",
                "description": "canvas：整张画布（含留白）放进系统图标的格子，规范 3.1 要求；visible 或不写：3.0 旧规则，裁到图形边缘再撑满格子。只能写在单个图标上。"}
      }
    },
    "transition": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["source", "from", "to"],
      "properties": {
        "source": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^assets/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,95}\\.json$"},
        "from": {"enum": ["on", "off", "transient"]}, "to": {"enum": ["on", "off"]},
        "reversible": {"type": "boolean", "default": false}, "sha256": {"$ref": "#/$defs/digest"}
      }
    }
  },
  "$comment": "cellular仅接受三个已登记目标的none/0..4状态，双排两层须保留19×16共用透明viewport，不可分别裁边撑满。其他范围保留原有角色语法；跨字段from/to、精确静态端点、其他已知目标状态、重复JSON键、字节摘要、PNG/XML/Lottie预算另由桌面工具和Android严格parser检查。"
}
